{
  // S108 D1a — markdown is NEVER formatted on save in this repo.
  //
  // The devcontainer turns on Prettier format-on-save for every file
  // (.devcontainer/devcontainer.json). On markdown that re-pads every table
  // on each save: a one-line edit to one cell of CLAUDE.md's Technology Stack
  // table measured 34 changed lines (S108), a two-line edit earlier produced a
  // 77-line diff, and TECH_DEBT.md is already 295 lines Prettier-unclean on
  // main. A diff that size buries the real change.
  //
  // This file takes effect WITHOUT a rebuild (workspace settings override the
  // machine settings the devcontainer seeds). `.prettierignore` backs it up for
  // anything that runs Prettier outside the editor.
  "[markdown]": {
    "editor.formatOnSave": false
  }
}
